{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01130",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 5.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Um, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.28,
      "end_seconds": 9.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.21,
      "end_seconds": 18.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "doctor, it's a burning pain in the upper tummy. It's getting on my nerves now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.08,
      "end_seconds": 29.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.68,
      "end_seconds": 37.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "I notice it more with spicy food. I'd say every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.61,
      "end_seconds": 41.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.59,
      "end_seconds": 60.22,
      "duration_seconds": 17.63,
      "text": "it, It usually comes with bloating after meals uh, the bloating after meals? That's been for two weeks as for bloating after meals, I'd give it a five, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.6,
      "end_seconds": 69.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "Alright, have you had a burning pain in the upper tummy before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.86,
      "end_seconds": 77.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.87,
      "end_seconds": 81.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.62,
      "end_seconds": 86.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Lansoprazole, before breakfast for my acidity"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.84,
      "end_seconds": 90.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.04,
      "end_seconds": 95.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "30 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.92,
      "end_seconds": 98.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.37,
      "end_seconds": 108.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux for five years now. Arthritis in my knees, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.8,
      "end_seconds": 116.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Alright, acid reflux, that matches what I have here. Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.29,
      "end_seconds": 123.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.76,
      "end_seconds": 127.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.63,
      "end_seconds": 132.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.76,
      "end_seconds": 138.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Right, what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.53,
      "end_seconds": 146.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "my mother had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.37,
      "end_seconds": 148.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.36,
      "end_seconds": 150.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.58,
      "end_seconds": 159.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "any black stools, trouble swallowing or vomiting blood at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.81,
      "end_seconds": 166.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "No, no black stools, trouble swallowing or vomiting blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.27,
      "end_seconds": 170.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Did you notice any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.01,
      "end_seconds": 172.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.03,
      "end_seconds": 177.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.81,
      "end_seconds": 180.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.85,
      "end_seconds": 201.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.2,
      "end_seconds": 211.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.65,
      "end_seconds": 233.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, pulse 83, temperature 37.0, pressure 109 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.94,
      "end_seconds": 237.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.46,
      "end_seconds": 245.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "they help me see the whole picture, more shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.0,
      "end_seconds": 250.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.25,
      "end_seconds": 253.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.12,
      "end_seconds": 266.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "No guarding and no lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.27,
      "end_seconds": 269.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "so, does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.93,
      "end_seconds": 289.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft, with mild tenderness in the upper middle part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.17,
      "end_seconds": 296.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.51,
      "end_seconds": 310.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? This is probably gastritis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.19,
      "end_seconds": 335.19,
      "duration_seconds": 16.0,
      "text": "An H. pylori test is what I'd like next, for dyspepsia. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'm sending you for an upper endoscopy because of persistent dyspepsia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.32,
      "end_seconds": 338.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "do I need to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.78,
      "end_seconds": 372.47,
      "duration_seconds": 31.69,
      "text": "Avoid spicy, oily food and don't take anti-inflammatory painkillers on an empty stomach. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. If it hasn't settled in a month, we'd think about blood tests, but not now. Let's plan a check in four weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.12,
      "end_seconds": 376.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.44,
      "end_seconds": 379.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
}